#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:233
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattleTowerSign"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE TOWER!\n"
"Keep the win streak as the toughest\l"
"TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"这里是对战塔！\n"
"作为最强的训练家，\l"
"保持连胜吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:238
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattlePalaceSign"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE PALACE!\n"
"Keep your eyes on POKéMON battles!$"
msgstr ""
"这里是对战宫殿！\n"
"注视着宝可梦的对战吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:242
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattleArenaSign"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE ARENA!\n"
"Let the toughest teams gather!$"
msgstr ""
"这里是对战竞技场！\n"
"最强的队伍在此集结！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:246
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattlePyramidSign"
msgid ""
"This is the BATTLE PYRAMID!\n"
"Advance through the Battle Quest!$"
msgstr ""
"这里是对战金字塔！\n"
"在对战探险中不断前进吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:250
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_RankingHallSign"
msgid ""
"BATTLE FRONTIER RANKING HALL\n"
"Set your sights on new records!$"
msgstr ""
"对战开拓区 排名馆\n"
"以新的纪录为目标吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:254
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ExchangeCornerSign"
msgid ""
"BATTLE POINT EXCHANGE SERVICE CORNER\n"
"Exchange your Battle Points!$"
msgstr ""
"对战点数兑换服务处\n"
"来兑换你的对战点数吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:258
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattleTowerFeelsSpecial"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"It's huge!\p"
"The BATTLE TOWER feels special.\n"
"It's different from the others.$"
msgstr ""
"哇！\n"
"好大啊！\p"
"对战塔感觉很特别。\n"
"和其他设施都不一样。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:264
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ConquerLeagueAndFrontier"
msgid ""
"My grand ambition is to conquer both\n"
"the BATTLE FRONTIER and the POKéMON\l"
"LEAGUE.\p"
"And if my dream comes true…\p"
"I… I'm going to ask MIMI next door\n"
"if she will be friends with me!$"
msgstr ""
"我的远大目标是同时征服\n"
"对战开拓区和宝可梦联盟。\p"
"要是我的梦想成真了……\p"
"我……我就要去问隔壁的美美，\n"
"愿不愿意和我做朋友！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PyramidTooHarsh"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE PYRAMID's too harsh!\n"
"I just can't make it to the top!\p"
"Since I'm out of options, maybe I can\n"
"climb the outside…$"
msgstr ""
"对战金字塔太难了！\n"
"我怎么也爬不到顶！\p"
"既然没别的办法了，\n"
"要不我从外面爬上去……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:278
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ThriveInDarkness"
msgid ""
"I thrive in darkness…\n"
"Yes… What is worthy of me?\l"
"None other than the BATTLE PYRAMID…\p"
"What say you to wandering in darkness\n"
"and in utter and total desperation?$"
msgstr ""
"黑暗才是我的归宿……\n"
"没错……什么才配得上我？\l"
"除了对战金字塔别无其他……\p"
"在黑暗中彷徨，\n"
"陷入彻彻底底的绝望，如何？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:285
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PutTogetherUltimateTeam"
msgid ""
"I didn't sleep for a week, but then\n"
"I put together the ultimate team!\p"
"I can't see myself losing, no joke.\n"
"We're storming the BATTLE ARENA!$"
msgstr ""
"我一个星期没睡觉，\n"
"终于组出了最强的队伍！\p"
"说真的，我根本想象不到自己会输。\n"
"我们要杀进对战竞技场了！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:291
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_DidScottBringYouHere"
msgid ""
"Did SCOTT bring you here, too?\n"
"What is it with that guy?\p"
"It sounds like he really does know\n"
"how to spot talented TRAINERS, but…\p"
"I've never seen him battling in person\n"
"ever.$"
msgstr ""
"你也是亚希达带来的吗？\n"
"那家伙到底是什么人啊？\p"
"他好像真的很会\n"
"发掘有天赋的训练家，可是……\p"
"我从来没亲眼见过他对战。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:299
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BelieveInYouBuddy"
msgid ""
"ZIGG!\n"
"I believe in you, little buddy!\p"
"I'll make my little ZIGG any favorite\n"
"tasty treats you like if you win!$"
msgstr ""
"小蛇纹！\n"
"我相信你，小伙伴！\p"
"要是你赢了，你喜欢吃的好东西\n"
"我都会做给你吃！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:305
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ZigzagoonLooksVacant"
msgid "ZIGZAGOON looks vacant…$"
msgstr "蛇纹熊看起来呆呆的……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:308
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PeopleCallMeBusybody"
msgid ""
"People call me a busybody,\n"
"but I can't help it.\p"
"Your hat's on crooked!\n"
"Oh, no, trash on the ground!\l"
"Oops, it's almost dinnertime!\p"
"I don't know if I can stand to just\n"
"watch at the BATTLE PALACE…$"
msgstr ""
"大家都说我爱管闲事，\n"
"可我就是忍不住。\p"
"你的帽子戴歪了！\n"
"哎呀，地上有垃圾！\l"
"糟了，快到吃晚饭的时间了！\p"
"在对战宫殿里只能在一旁看着，\n"
"不知道我受不受得了……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:317
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_OnceBeatGymLeader"
msgid ""
"I may not look that impressive now,\n"
"but I once beat a GYM LEADER.\p"
"Who knows, maybe I should give it\n"
"another shot at glory.$"
msgstr ""
"我现在看起来可能不怎么样，\n"
"但我曾经打败过道馆馆主哦。\p"
"说不定，我应该\n"
"再去挑战一次荣耀。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:323
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_FastOnBikeAndBattles"
msgid ""
"I'm fast on my BIKE, and that goes for\n"
"the way I battle, too.\p"
"I win matches in the blink of\n"
"an eye!$"
msgstr ""
"我骑自行车很快，\n"
"对战也一样快。\p"
"我眨眼之间就能赢下比赛！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:329
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BetterThanDaddyAtPokemon"
msgid ""
"I'm better than my daddy\n"
"at POKéMON.$"
msgstr "我玩宝可梦比爸爸还厉害。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:333
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_GoRackUpSomeWinsForDaddy"
msgid ""
"Go on, my baby sweetie!\n"
"Go rack up some wins for Daddy!\p"
"You're just like your mother,\n"
"so you'll be dominating!$"
msgstr ""
"去吧，我的小宝贝！\n"
"为爸爸多赢几场吧！\p"
"你和你妈妈一模一样，\n"
"一定会所向无敌的！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:339
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_HeardPrettyGirlAtBattleArena"
msgid ""
"It wasn't easy getting here,\n"
"but I'd heard about this knockout\l"
"pretty girl at the BATTLE ARENA.\p"
"Instead of her, do you know what\n"
"I found?\p"
"A whole teeming mob of sweaty,\n"
"stinky, and primitive martial artists!$"
msgstr ""
"来这里可不容易，\n"
"但我听说对战竞技场里\l"
"有个超级漂亮的女孩子。\p"
"结果你知道我看到了什么吗？\p"
"一大群汗流浃背、浑身发臭、\n"
"野蛮粗犷的格斗家！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:348
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_SometimesImportantOldManInThere"
msgid ""
"I sometimes see this really important-\n"
"looking old man going in there.\p"
"He has these really awesome POKéMON.\n"
"He seems really nice, though.$"
msgstr ""
"我有时候会看到一个看起来\n"
"很了不起的老爷爷走进那里。\p"
"他有很厉害的宝可梦。\n"
"不过他看起来人很好。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_LegendOfBattlePyramid"
msgid ""
"Do you know it?\n"
"The legend of the BATTLE PYRAMID?\p"
"When there comes a confident TRAINER\n"
"reaching for the golden pinnacle,\l"
"there shall appear a man among men.\p"
"Don't know that legend?\n"
"Well, of course not!\l"
"I just made it up!\p"
"What's it supposed to mean?\n"
"That, my friend, I can't say!$"
msgstr ""
"你知道吗？\n"
"对战金字塔的传说？\p"
"当自信的训练家\n"
"伸手触及黄金之巅时，\l"
"人中豪杰便会现身。\p"
"不知道这个传说？\n"
"嗯，你当然不知道！\l"
"因为是我刚编的！\p"
"那是什么意思？\n"
"这个嘛，朋友，我也说不上来！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_GotWipedOut"
msgid ""
"Man! Oh man!\n"
"I've never lost once before!\p"
"But I got wiped out with no saving\n"
"grace at all!\p"
"And then I'm told I don't have any\n"
"talent?! Man!$"
msgstr ""
"可恶！真可恶！\n"
"我以前从来没输过！\p"
"可是这次我被打得\n"
"毫无招架之力！\p"
"然后还被说没有天赋？！\n"
"可恶！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:374
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ToughTrainerInBattleTower"
msgid ""
"This guy ran into a horribly tough\n"
"TRAINER while he was on the BATTLE\l"
"TOWER challenge.\p"
"Now look at him…\p"
"You need to be cautious if you ever\n"
"decide to go to the BATTLE TOWER.$"
msgstr ""
"这家伙在挑战对战塔的时候，\n"
"碰上了一个强得可怕的训练家。\p"
"现在你看看他……\p"
"如果你要去对战塔，\n"
"可得小心一点。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:382
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_EnoughBattlePointsForDoll"
msgid ""
"Yes!\n"
"I've finally got enough Battle Points!\p"
"I guess I'll trade for another giant\n"
"plush DOLL!$"
msgstr ""
"太好了！\n"
"我终于攒够对战点数了！\p"
"我要再去换一个\n"
"巨大的毛绒玩偶！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:388
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_LikeToHaveNameRecordedHere"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, okay!\n"
"So this is the RANKING HALL!\p"
"I'd like to go down in history as\n"
"a super champ and have my name\l"
"recorded here for posterity.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，好，原来如此！\n"
"这里就是排名馆啊！\p"
"我想作为超级冠军名留青史，\n"
"让我的名字记录在这里，\l"
"流传给后世。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:395
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_CanDoAnythingWithYou"
msgid "With you by my side, I can do anything.$"
msgstr "有你在我身边，我无所不能。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PowerOfOurLoveWillOvercome"
msgid ""
"Ooh, darling, you are so wonderful!\p"
"Ooh, I just can't wait anymore!\p"
"Let's go to a MULTI BATTLE ROOM\n"
"right this instant!\p"
"If we get together in the BATTLE SALON,\n"
"the power of our love will overcome\l"
"everyone we meet.\p"
"Why, before us, darling, everything\n"
"will topple like dominoes!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，亲爱的，你真是太棒了！\p"
"哦，我已经等不及了！\p"
"我们马上去多人对战室吧！\p"
"只要我们在对战沙龙联手，\n"
"我们的爱的力量\l"
"就能战胜遇到的所有人。\p"
"亲爱的，在我们面前，\n"
"一切都会像多米诺骨牌一样倒下！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:409
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_FrontierNotExclusivelyForToughTrainers"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE FRONTIER isn't exclusively\n"
"for tough TRAINERS.\p"
"Many people with special abilities\n"
"have been invited, it seems.\p"
"That man SCOTT…\p"
"He may have built this place to serve\n"
"a bigger objective…$"
msgstr ""
"对战开拓区并不是\n"
"只属于强大训练家的地方。\p"
"好像有很多拥有特殊才能的人\n"
"也被邀请来了。\p"
"那个叫亚希达的人……\p"
"他建造这个地方，\n"
"也许是为了更大的目的……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:418
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_OddTreeHereSeemsToWiggle"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, young one.\n"
"Have you good eyesight?\p"
"There is an odd tree past here, and to\n"
"my tired eyes it seems to wiggle.$"
msgstr ""
"打扰一下，年轻人。\n"
"你的眼力好吗？\p"
"前面有一棵奇怪的树，\n"
"我这双老眼看它好像在晃动。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:424
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_OnceAnOddTreePastHere"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, young one.\n"
"Have you a good memory?\p"
"I have this feeling there once was\n"
"an odd tree past here.$"
msgstr ""
"打扰一下，年轻人。\n"
"你的记性好吗？\p"
"我总觉得前面\n"
"以前有一棵奇怪的树。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_OutsideEast/scripts.inc:430
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_StickyMonWithLongTail"
msgid ""
"I…\n"
"I saw it!\p"
"There was a sticky sort of a POKéMON\n"
"with a long tail up ahead!\p"
"It was hiding under a boulder, and\n"
"it kept staring at me!$"
msgstr ""
"我……\n"
"我看到了！\p"
"前面有一只黏糊糊的、\n"
"尾巴很长的宝可梦！\p"
"它躲在大石头下面，\n"
"一直盯着我看！$"
